# Declension: en.wiktionary.org, https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/áratugur (indefinite forms).
# The construction imposes the case -- dative after "fyrir" (ago),
# accusative after "eftir" (in) -- and the count imposes the number,
# so every indefinite form of the noun is a surface of this unit.
áratugur
áratug
áratugar
áratugir
áratugi
áratugum
áratuga
